| 5. Water/Puddle vertical slice | `/Game/ReactiveSurface/Water/NS_RS_Water`, `/Game/ReactiveSurface/Water/BP_RS_PuddleVolume` | Blueprint, Niagara, Material, MPC | Record ripple nonzero, decay-to-empty, and no runaway amplification. | Internal / user look check |
| 6. Sleep/wake + RT lifecycle | Controller lifecycle graphs, channel gate functions | Blueprint, Niagara | Empty slots clear RT; Ground+Grass simultaneous active produces both RTs nonzero on the `activate(false)` production path; lifecycle B sleep/hold/recenter/switch checks pass. | Blocks Phase 7 only if lifecycle B fails |
| 7. Integrated profiling | `/Game/ReactiveSurface/Test/` temp validation map | Unreal Insights/ProfileGPU, MCP readback | Re-run 50-candidate/20-slot collection with production assets; do not use excluded 3RT timing. | Internal |
